<section class="problem" id="problem">
  <p class="eyebrow">Fig. 2 — The problem</p>
  <h2>The same layers are sent again on every call.</h2>
  <p class="section-lede">
    The model keeps no memory between calls, so the harness resends every layer each time. Against a
    1M window the starting load looks small. Over a month of sessions it is most of what the model
    reads, and nothing in the harness shows it to you.
  </p>
